# Nested planning/ directories. The rule above is anchored (`/planning`), so it
# only ever covered the repo-root symlink into the brain vault — a REAL planning
# directory created anywhere below the root slipped straight past it and was
# tracked and pushed. That happened: engine-rs shipped
# crates/engine-core/planning/ (knowledge.md, memory.md, archived SDLC worklogs)
# to its public GitHub remote for weeks. Anchored-rule gap, not a one-off.
**/planning/
